    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## W2 \u2014 Site visit booking \u00b7 Electrical contractor\n\n**Boundary: automated proposal, human confirm above CHF 5000.**\nAbove roughly CHF 5,000 a job is usually multi-day and schedule-disrupting, so the owner wants to see the booking before it is offered. Scored 3/2/4.\n\n### The measurable thing here is travel\nClustering by locality is the whole point. Travel minutes per job, before and after, is unambiguous and it converts directly to money \u2014 the easiest result in the whole project to defend.\n\nRecord the unclustered estimate too, or you have nothing to compare against. The **Cluster by locality** node writes both.",
        "width": 480,
        "height": 380,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "bf6d5589-c759-4308-8506-c454b3c4d6df",
      "name": "Note 1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -820,
        -360
      ]
    },
